OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day for most,
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of light drizzle
OL,7,Faffecting eastern coasts and hills.
OL,8,FThe best of any brighter or sunnier
OL,9,Fspells expected in the west. Mainly
OL,10,Flight easterly or southeasterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FContinuing rather cloudy with
OL,13,Fpatchy drizzle, but there will be some
OL,14,Fclearer spells around, especially in
OL,15,Fthe west where patchy fog and perhaps
OL,16,Fa touch of frost may develop.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,176,160,301,260,100,100
