OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F175A1793939139
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FStill quite a lot of cloud
OL,6,Faround, with patchy rain possible
OL,7,Facross Lochaber, but a bit more in the
OL,8,Fway of bright or sunny spells than
OL,9,Frecently. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FLittle
OL,12,Fchange, rather cloudy through into
OL,13,Fnext week, with patchy drizzle or
OL,14,Fshowers in north and east. Where any
OL,15,Fcloud breaks occur, overnight fog and
OL,16,Ffrost may develop.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
